  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to durable solutions for displacement-affected Afghans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Refugee Council (Flyktninghjelpen) will support in strengthening education systems to improve access and retention in quality education for displacement-affected children and youth, through non-formal transitional and alternative education (community-based, accelerated), enrolment in formal education and provision of psychosocial support. In addition, NRC will also support in strengthening access to livelihoods opportunities and improve food security of displacement-affected households. Specific attention is on ensuring girls&apos; and women&apos;s participation in these programmes, tailoring programming to make sure this can happen.</narrative>
  </description>
